# Trial directories are hundreds of megabytes of per-trial journals, receipt logs and fault logs.
# The published *rows* are five, and they are the unit the reports are folded from — a repository
# that publishes conclusions without them is asking to be taken on trust (§15.10).
bench/results/**
!bench/results/*/
!bench/results/*/results.jsonl
# Not published: a superseded partial run and a one-off probe.
bench/results/tier1a-v1/
bench/results/mcprobe/
.env

# World receipt logs written by the demo
.demo-receipts-*.jsonl

# working notes and phase write-ups: explanation, not source
notes/

# agent working brief: tooling, not source
CLAUDE.md
